### IMPERIA ESTATES API Test Collection
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@imperiaestates.com",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}

### 3. Login Customer
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@imperiaestates.com",
  "password": "Customer@123456"
}

### Store Token Variables from Login Response above
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}
@customerToken = {{loginCustomer.response.body.data.token}}

### 4. Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 5. Get All Properties (with filtering, sorting & pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?purpose=Buy&city=Chennai&sort=price_desc&page=1&limit=6

### 6. Get Single Property
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/imperia-ritz

### 7. Search Properties
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=Coimbatore

### 8. Toggle Property in Wishlist
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/wishlist/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "imperia-ritz"
}

### 9. Get User Wishlist
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 10. Toggle Property in Compare List (Max 4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/compare/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "imperia-skyline"
}

### 11. Get User Compare List
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/compare
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 12. Book Site Visit (Public Guest / User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/site-visits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "imperia-ritz",
  "propertyName": "The Ritz-Carlton Residences",
  "name": "Anand Sharma",
  "email": "anand.s@example.com",
  "phone": "+91 99887 76655",
  "date": "2026-03-15",
  "time": "03:00 PM"
}

### 13. Get My Site Visits
GET {{baseUrl}}/site-visits/my-visits
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 14. Admin: Get CRM Customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 15. Public: Get Blogs
GET {{baseUrl}}/blogs

### 16. Submit Public Inquiry
POST {{baseUrl}}/inquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Kavitha R",
  "email": "kavitha@example.com",
  "phone": "+91 91234 56789",
  "serviceRequested": "Interior Design Consulting",
  "message": "I would like to inquire about luxury interior customization."
}

### 17. Admin: Get Inquiries
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/inquiries
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
